init_docs_sidebar()!
#[section, $md:
    # Directives

    `$` introduces a registered compiler or builder directive. Template
    formatters already use this marker. The accepted general family extends it
    to configuration, future root purpose and later compiler-owned blocks.
    HTML document metadata uses direct const root inserts through builder slots.

    Template directives are implemented. The general non-template family is
    accepted design and is not yet available in the Alpha compiler. The earlier
    `$page` proposal is superseded; general `$entry` remains deferred.
]

